nning, and the chart ends at $118.70.","lesson":"This is an example of a shakeout. The breakout failed by the rules, closing below the level three days running, and then the stock recovered and ran. Cutting it was still the right call when it happened. A failed breakout that fixes itself is worth watching for a re-entry, not a reason to ignore the exit."}}